"b": "Background and interests Contact details and basic information Full name Raúl Antuña Suárez Location Asturias, Spain Email rolitoansu@outlook.com Company Hiberus — AEM Backend Engineer Education Master's in Web Engineering — University of Oviedo Languages Spanish (native), English (B2) I'm Raúl Antuña, born and raised in Asturias. After finishing my Bachelor's degree in Computer Engineering at the University of Oviedo (2022-2026), I joined Hiberus as an AEM intern and since July 2026 I work full time as an AEM Backend Engineer. At the same time I'm studying the Master's in Web Engineering, where I go deeper into standards, accessibility and advanced web computing. I like well-crafted software: readable code, accessible interfaces and solutions that keep working as time goes by. Adobe Experience Manager Web computing UX / UI Frontend Open Source"
